# Emperor of Bones: at the beginning of combat on its controller's turn it exiles up to one target card from a graveyard
# (here the Llanowar Elves Bot1's own Bolt killed); "{1}{B}: Adapt 2" puts two +1/+1 counters on it, and "whenever one or more
# +1/+1 counters are put on this creature" it puts a creature card exiled with it onto the battlefield with a finality
# counter and haste, to be sacrificed at the beginning of the next end step, where the finality counter exiles it instead
# of letting it reach the graveyard (CR 122.1h).

